<title>JAPAN: NHK Spring jumps on IBM technical tie-up news.</title>
<headline>NHK Spring jumps on IBM technical tie-up news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in NHK Spring Co Ltd jumped on Tuesday afternoon after the firm said it would announce a technical tie-up with International Business Machines Co later in the day, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0452 GMT, the shares were up by 49 yen, or 10.96 percent, at 496, making NHK Spring the largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.  </p>
<p>&quot;A tie-up with IBM will improve the image of the firm and investors are hoping that NHK Spring will transform into a high-tech firm,&quot; said a broker at a middle-sized brokerage.</p>
</text>
